-115f10b931bd" :answer/id #uuid "e16713cd-abd3-504a-8c15-115f10b931bd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-9" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-9e34d6f8-49da-5db8-87f3-8785875346ab" :question/id #uuid "9e34d6f8-49da-5db8-87f3-8785875346ab" :question/math-academy-id "q-236773" :question/problem "$0-2=${{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "To subtract $2$ from $0$, we start at $0$ on the number line and move $2$ places to the left. \n\n![](images/69/69175ac7cedd4c02700fd0923debd8c157f92e599390fb2c32a42ffd7bfed535.png)\n\nThis gives $0-2=-2.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-04eb71a4-a0d2-5756-bece-e5826c794ace"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-04eb71a4-a0d2-5756-bece-e5826c794ace" :answer-field/id #uuid "04eb71a4-a0d2-5756-bece-e5826c794ace" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-7a615f07-c8d6-5c0f-a473-71dff96fb6a6" :answer-field/choices ["answer-7a615f07-c8d6-5c0f-a473-71dff96fb6a6"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-7a615f07-c8d6-5c0f-a473-71dff96fb6a6" :answer/id #uuid "7a615f07-c8d6-5c0f-a473-71dff96fb6a6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-e5943f62-70f0-5c53-ab7a-920918d09afb" :question/id #uuid "e5943f62-70f0-5c53-ab7a-920918d09afb" :question/math-academy-id "q-236831" :question/problem "$9-35=${{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "Since $35$ is larger than $9,$ the answer will be negative.\n\nWe start by solving an easier problem:\n\n$$\n35-9\n$$\n\nNext, we carry out the subtraction:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} &  & \\,\\,\\,\\begin{aligned}\\,\\,\\,2\\end{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\begin{aligned}\\,\\,\\,15\\end{aligned} \\\\  &  & \\,\\,\\,3\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,5\\,\\,\\, \\\\ \\,\\,\\,\\,-\\,\\,\\,\\, &  &  & \\,\\,\\,9\\,\\,\\, \\\\  &  & \\,\\,\\,2\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,6\\,\\,\\,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we have\n\n$$\n35-9=26.\n$$\n\nHowever, since our answer must be negative, we need to change the sign of the answer above. \n\nTherefore, we conclude that\n\n$$\n9-35=-26.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-e9752cd8-4e89-56c5-bc9f-13cd61512e62"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-e9752cd8-4e89-56c5-bc9f-13cd61512e62" :answer-field/id #uuid "e9752cd8-4e89-56c5-bc9f-13cd61512e62" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-754006bc-2b64-5560-ac65-09c39ed5103d" :answer-field/choices ["answer-754006bc-2b64-5560-ac65-09c39ed5103d"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-754006bc-2b64-5560-ac65-09c39ed5103d" :answer/id #uuid "754006bc-2b64-5560-ac65-09c39ed5103d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-26" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-bceb489c-a699-54cb-aed4-c91f526fac06" :question/id #uuid "bceb489c-a699-54cb-aed4-c91f526fac06" :question/math-academy-id "q-6102" :question/problem "$100-212=$" :question/worked-solution "Since $212$ is larger than $100,$ the answer will be negative.\n\nWe start by solving an easier problem:\n\n$$\n212-100\n$$\n\nNext, we carry out the subtraction:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} &  & \\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\, \\\\  &  & \\,\\,\\,2\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,1\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,2\\,\\,\\, \\\\ \\,\\,\\,\\,-\\,\\,\\,\\, &  & \\,\\,\\,1\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,0\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,0\\,\\,\\, \\\\  &  & \\,\\,\\,1\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,1\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,2\\,\\,\\,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we have\n\n$$\n212-100=112.\n$$\n\nHowever, since our answer must be negative, we need to change the sign of the answer above. \n\nTherefore, we conclude that\n\n$$\n100-212=-112\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-fe1f0b9c-c9e8-5a12-a467-e1100119fece"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-fe1f0b9c-c9e8-5a12-a467-e1100119fece" :answ